---
const rows = [
	{ name: 'Augury', market: 'Enterprise', entry: '$1M+', deploy: 'Managed service', note: 'Fortune 500 only', highlight: false },
	{ name: 'Tractian', market: 'Enterprise', entry: '$200K+', deploy: 'Managed service', note: 'Moving down-market', highlight: false },
	{ name: 'Petasense', market: 'SMB', entry: 'Moderate', deploy: 'Managed', note: 'Under-resourced', highlight: false },
	{ name: 'Senseye', market: 'Enterprise', entry: 'High', deploy: 'Managed', note: 'Acquired by Siemens', highlight: false },
	{ name: 'KCF / SmartDiagnostics', market: 'Mid-market', entry: 'Medium', deploy: 'Consulting model', note: 'Service-led, not productized', highlight: false },
	{ name: 'MidMon', market: 'Mid-market', entry: '< $10K / line', deploy: 'Self-install', note: 'Edge AI, RaaS', highlight: true },
];
---

<section id="comparison" class="relative py-24 md:py-32">
	<div class="container-x">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
			<div data-reveal>
				<span class="section-eyebrow">Where we sit</span>
			</div>
			<h2 data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1" class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white md:text-5xl">
				The market is split in two. <span class="text-accent">We sit in the gap.</span>
			</h2>
			<p data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2" class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl text-[var(--color-text-muted)] md:text-lg">
				Enterprise platforms are optimized for $500K+ deals. SMB tools are under-resourced. Nobody
				has productized edge AI for the segment in between.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div data-reveal class="mt-12">
			<div class="card overflow-hidden p-0">
				<div class="hidden border-b border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] px-6 py-4 text-[10px] font-medium tracking-widest text-[var(--color-text-dim)] uppercase md:grid md:grid-cols-[1.6fr_1fr_1.1fr_1.2fr_1.4fr]">
					<div>Platform</div>
					<div>Target market</div>
					<div>Entry cost</div>
					<div>Deployment</div>
					<div>Notable</div>
				</div>

				<div class="divide-y divide-white/5">
					{
						rows.map((row) => (
							<div class={`grid grid-cols-2 items-center gap-y-2 px-6 py-5 md:grid-cols-[1.6fr_1fr_1.1fr_1.2fr_1.4fr] ${row.highlight ? 'bg-[#2dd4bf]/[0.05]' : ''}`}>
								<div class="col-span-2 flex items-center gap-2 md:col-span-1">
									<span class={row.highlight ? 'font-semibold text-white' : 'text-white/90'}>
										{row.name}
									</span>
									{row.highlight && (
										<span class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#2dd4bf]/40 bg-[#2dd4bf]/10 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-medium tracking-widest text-[#5eead4] uppercase">
											us
										</span>
									)}
								</div>
								<div class="text-xs text-[var(--color-text-muted)] md:text-sm">{row.market}</div>
								<div class={`font-mono text-xs md:text-sm ${row.highlight ? 'text-[#5eead4]' : 'text-[var(--color-text-muted)]'}`}>
									{row.entry}
								</div>
								<div class="text-xs text-[var(--color-text-muted)] md:text-sm">{row.deploy}</div>
								<div class={`text-xs md:text-sm ${row.highlight ? 'text-white' : 'text-[var(--color-text-muted)]'}`}>
									{row.note}
								</div>
							</div>
						))
					}
				</div>
			</div>

			<p data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1" class="mt-6 text-center text-xs text-[var(--color-text-dim)]">
				Augury raised $75M in Feb 2025 at a $1B+ valuation. Tractian closed a $120M Series C in
				Dec 2024. The category is funded. The mid-market is open.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
